 vember on the third Wednesday of the month for welcoming and engaging conv
 ersations. Books will be provided. Attendance at each discussion meeting 
 is required in order to receive the next book in the series. \n\nJoin us f
 or the concluding discussion in our classic literature series. During this
  final meeting\, we will discuss Edith Wharton’s The House of Mirth\, ex
 ploring its themes of ambition\, social pressure\, class\, and personal fr
 eedom as Lily Bart navigates the glittering yet fragile world of New York 
