SUMMARY:[ATH] It's Sew Easy: Mini-Tote
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T140000
DTSTAMP:20260724T042407Z
UID:smcl-6a5e85b41bbbb30f3e80a699@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Interested in picking up the fun life skill of sewing? Missed 
 out on those cute mini totes from a certain popular grocery chain? Now is 
 your chance to make your very own Mini-Tote.\n\nWhether you're a beginner 
 or experienced sewist\, this project is perfect for learning how to upcycl
 e materials. You'll also get hands-on experience cutting pattern pieces\, 
 sewing straight stitches\, pressing seams\, and more. This program is open
  only to adults 18+.\n\nSpace is limited\, so please register at smcl.org/
 events  to reserve your spot. The two sessions are identical\, so please o
 nly sign up for one. We will start letting participants in no earlier than
  the start time.\n\nAges: Adult program (kids welcome to tag along\, not d
 esigned for them)\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocomm
 ons.com/events/6a5e85b41bbbb30f3e80a699\nLast synced: 2026-07-23 21:24 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a5e85b41bbbb30f3e80a699
END:VEVENT
